# Nested: inner, outer, root hear the down; outer and root the up.
tap pick
# A box hearing only pointermove holds the moves; the root still hears the down and up.
down move-row
move 30 0
up
# A pan takes its contact; the root still hears the down and the up.
drag panner 60 0 200
# In a popover: the popover's up, then its authored ancestors'.
tap open
tap pop-row
